---
description: Apply when changing Ronin Mom public pages, components, navigation, typography, color, imagery, layout, or marketing copy.
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `@.cursor/skills/roninmom-brand-direction/SKILL.md` before material brand work.
- Read `@.cursor/skills/editorial-experience-design/SKILL.md` before creating or materially restructuring a homepage, article, category, newsletter, or editorial component.
- Make the first viewport state who the site helps and what the reader can do next.
- Prefer editorial hierarchy, readable measure, authentic imagery, and selective field-journal details.
- Avoid emoji interface graphics, generic gradients, glassmorphism, repetitive card walls, faux-handwritten clutter, samurai clichés, and generic beige lifestyle-template styling.
- Validate responsive behavior and accessibility before completion.
